{"slug":"bernie-sanders","qid":"Q359442","name":"Bernie Sanders","desc":"United States Senator from Vermont","article":"Bernie Sanders","born":"1941-09-08","died":null,"birthplace":"Brooklyn","parties":["Independent","Democratic Party","Liberty Union Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Senator","w":"Vermont","f":2007,"u":null},{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"VT-AL","f":1991,"u":2007},{"t":"Mayor of Burlington, Vermont","w":"","f":1981,"u":1989}],"summary":"Bernard  Sanders (born September 8, 1941) is an American politician and activist serving as the senior United States senator from Vermont, a seat he has held since 2007. He is the longest-serving independent in U.S. congressional history, but maintains a close relationship with the Democratic Party, having caucused with House and Senate Democrats for most of his congressional career and sought the party's presidential nomination in 2016 and 2020. Ideologically a democratic socialist, Sanders is regarded as one of the leading figures of the 21st-century American progressive movement.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":2024,"o":"S","k":"VT","p":"I","v":229429,"s":63.16,"w":true,"n":"Bernie Sanders"},{"y":2018,"o":"S","k":"VT","p":"I","v":183529,"s":67.32,"w":true,"n":"Bernie Sanders"},{"y":2012,"o":"S","k":"VT","p":"I","v":207848,"s":71.0,"w":true,"n":"Bernard Sanders"},{"y":2006,"o":"S","k":"VT","p":"I","v":171638,"s":65.41,"w":true,"n":"Bernard Sanders"},{"y":2004,"o":"H","k":"VT-AL","p":"I","v":205774,"s":67.47,"w":true,"n":"Bernard Sanders"},{"y":2002,"o":"H","k":"VT-AL","p":"I","v":144880,"s":64.32,"w":true,"n":"Bernard Sanders"},{"y":2000,"o":"H","k":"VT-AL","p":"I","v":196118,"s":69.21,"w":true,"n":"Bernard Sanders"},{"y":1998,"o":"H","k":"VT-AL","p":"I","v":136403,"s":63.4,"w":true,"n":"Bernard Sanders"},{"y":1996,"o":"H","k":"VT-AL","p":"I","v":140678,"s":55.23,"w":true,"n":"Bernard Sanders"},{"y":1994,"o":"H","k":"VT-AL","p":"I","v":105502,"s":49.89,"w":true,"n":"Bernard Sanders"},{"y":1992,"o":"H","k":"VT-AL","p":"I